Z||000000||Haze_Performance||11-07-2001||06:51 AM||||I just checked my Private Messages.<P>This is an apology to Boomtastic. He was very upset that I was <u>UNKNOWINGLY</u> using his artwork in my signature. A while back someone emailed me with a website to add to my site. (Not Boomtastic) That person had the pic on his site. I asked him if I could use it & <u>he</u> said yes. I will discontinue using the signature. I believe I've been a member long enough to show that I'm not here to cause trouble. I apologize for the mixup. <P>-Haze||||reg||4
