Z||000003||Boomtastic||11-07-2001||10:30 AM||||Haze - you are vindicated. I accept the apology and am sorry for the confusion. If you or anyone else wishes to use *anything* from my website, please feel free to do so but with credit given back to the site. I know that in the next few months a LOT of content will be added to my site, and a LOT of it will end up being "used" with or without my permission. In this day, when it's as easy as right-clicking a picture to save it, I would be remiss to try and stop anyone who did so. So instead, I offer all images frely as long as they remain unedited and credited correctly. I believe that is only fair, and hope that you do to.<P>------------------<BR>Boomtastic<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mirror_md_clr.gif"> ||||reg||14
